ia-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261121-burnham-nd-168a3e.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261117-amazon-bond-jg-d1a5c1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261118-cybersecurity-vsb-2314-263fc7.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261116-reagan-airport-mb-0935-c48bcd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261119-Justin-Herbert-vsb-2004-e15fb6.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261119-aoc-kamala-split-ww-1149-5f03e6.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261120-dateline-only-fans-lr-770ed6.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261120-army-ammunitions-iowa-ww-1053-378c85.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261120-mark-kelly-josh-hawley-bf-1539-ed8237.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261120-trump-and-putin-sjr-1622-58b2ae.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261120-fiona-the-hippo-sjr-1324-8b0435.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261119-texas-space-institute-emily-oswold-ew-232p-79901a.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261120-usda-breach-sjr-1612-83d60a.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <p>Over the past decade, two dozen major automakers have recalled more than 100 million vehicles fitted with Takata airbag inflators worldwide, including about 67 million vehicles in the United States.</p>\n    <p>Various automakers have also reported hundreds of injuries in vehicles since 2009 from Takata airbag inflators that can explode, unleashing metal shrapnel inside cars and trucks, killing or injuring drivers or other vehicle occupants.</p>\n    <p>Honda said long-term monitoring and analysis revealed potential propellant degradation in certain inflators within specific geographic regions.</p>\n    <p>Toyota warned that degraded propellant could cause the inflator to rupture if the airbag deploys and cause serious injuries.</p>\n    <p>The Honda recall applies to vehicles sold or registered in Alabama, California, Florida, Georgia, Hawaii, Louisiana, Mississippi, South Carolina, Texas, Puerto Rico, the U.S. Virgin Islands, the Northern Mariana Islands (Saipan), Guam and American Samoa.</p>\n    <p>Toyota did not specify in which U.S. states the recall applies but said it expects the replacement inflators will be ready by early 2027.</p>\n  ", "word_count": 531, "status": "full", "reason": null, "summary": "The automakers will replace airbag inflators in about 1.1 million vehicles in the U.S. and say no crashes or injuries have been linked to the latest recalls.", "extracted_at": "2026-11-22T05:44:17-0500", "http": "200"}